{"id":24,"text":"A big lion was sleeping under a tree. A small mouse ran over his nose. The lion woke up and was very angry. He caught the mouse with his big paw.\n\n“Please let me go,” said the mouse. “One day, I will help you.”\n\nThe lion laughed. “You? You are too small to help me!” But he let the mouse go.\n\nA few days later, hunters came to the forest. They caught the lion in a strong net. The lion shouted loudly, but he could not get out.\n\nThe little mouse heard him and came quickly. “Don’t worry,” he said. “I will help you.”\n\nThe mouse used his small teeth. He cut the ropes one by one. Soon, the net was open, and the lion was free.\n\n“Thank you, my friend,” said the lion. “I was wrong. Small friends can be great friends.”\n\nThe mouse smiled. From that day, the lion and the mouse were good friends.\n\nMoral: Nobody is too small to help.","tr":null,"gl":{"a":"bir (noaniq artikl)","big":"katta","lion":"sher","was":"edi","sleeping":"uxlayotgan","under":"ostida","tree":"daraxt","small":"kichik","mouse":"sichqon","ran":"yugurdi","over":"ustidan; tugadi; davomida","his":"uning","nose":"burun","the":"(aniq artikl)","woke":"uyg'ondi","up":"yuqoriga","and":"va","very":"juda","angry":"jahli chiqqan","he":"u (erkak)","caught":"tutdi, ilib oldi","with":"bilan","paw":"panja","please":"iltimos","let":"ruxsat bermoq; qani, ...aylik","me":"meni, menga","go":"bormoq","said":"dedi","one":"bir, bitta","day":"kun","i":"men","will":"-adi (kelasi zamon)","help":"yordam; yordam bermoq","you":"sen, siz","laughed":"kuldi","are":"-dir, -siz, -lar (to be)","too":"ham; juda","to":"-ga; uchun","but":"lekin, ammo","few":"bir nechta, oz","days":"kunlar","later":"keyinroq","hunters":"ovchilar","came":"keldi","forest":"o'rmon","they":"ular","in":"ichida, -da","strong":"kuchli","net":"to'r","shouted":"baqirdi","loudly":"baland ovozda","could":"qila olardi","not":"emas","get":"olmoq, bo'lmoq","out":"tashqariga","little":"kichkina; oz","heard":"eshitdi","him":"uni, unga","quickly":"tez",